title Vinyl P2a: the sleep timer running (30 minutes chosen 48 s ago: "Stops in 29:12", the music fading over the last 10 s), the Sleep timer page with its status line and the Menu with the time left (480x320 and 320x480 at their real density)
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 630
# the 3.5-inch panel's 6.3 px/mm: ROW 44, the approved 480x320 layout's volume group and seek row 43 px (the owner's rule R-4)
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE sleep
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP 30
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP_LEFT 1753

wait 900
shot 01-sleep-running
expect text "30 minutes"
expect text "STOP PLAYING AFTER"
key left
wait 400
shot 02-menu-running
expect text "Sleep timer"
key left
wait 400
shot 03-now-running
expect noquit
